Add Grid to `code.highcharts.com`.


To test add this at the top of the `loadScript`
```
window.products = {
            “Highcharts”: {
                “date”: “2024-12-21”,
                “nr”: “12.1.2”
            },
            “Highcharts Stock”: {
                “date”: “2024-12-21",
                “nr”: “12.1.2"
            },
            “Highcharts Maps”: {
                “date”: “2024-12-21”,
                “nr”: “12.1.2”
            },
            “Highcharts Gantt”: {
